Credits
-------

Agents Kit Svelte was built fresh to match the look of Agents Kit
(https://github.com/agents-ui/agents-kit) only. No code was copied or
translated from it.

The warm, soft visual style is inspired by the look and feel of Claude Code
by Anthropic (https://www.anthropic.com/claude-code). Agents Kit Svelte is an
independent project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.

Icons are from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), released under the ISC License.
